Gents (and ladies, of course),

I was just wondering if someone had taken charge of porting the vt8231 driver
to 2.6.x. and/or the current status of such a port.

Starting from Roy Thompson's code I just got a version working (lm_sensors-2.8.7
userland and kernel 2.6.8.1) which matches the results given by the
lm_sensors-2.8.7 version under 2.4.27.  Unfortunately, my testing pool is
exactly one unit, an EPIA 800 motherboard.

I would be more than happy to submit this code to the project, but it seems
appropriate to pass it through the maintainers first.

Thank you,

